     5	/// <c>order-extractor</c> lives in the sibling folder <c>../order-extractor/</c>, relative to
     6	/// the AppHost. The project is <c>src/*.csproj</c> inside it (the scaffold layout), falling
     7	/// back to a flat <c>order-extractor.csproj</c>; its local Dapr components live in
     8	/// <c>local/dapr-components/</c>.
